  // HOW TO EDIT THIS FILE (you can do it from the GitHub website or the GitHub mobile app)
  //
  //  Add a company:  add one line to "sources" with a link to its job board. Examples:
  //      "https://jobs.lever.co/acme",
  //      "https://boards.greenhouse.io/acme",
  //      "https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/acme",
  //      "https://apply.workable.com/acme",
  //      "https://acme.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/SiteName",   <- Workday careers page (copy the address of its job list)
  //      "lever:acme",                         <- shorthand also works (greenhouse:/lever:/ashby:/workable:)
  //  Every line except the last one in a list must end with a comma.
  //  The company name shown in the email is taken from the link. To choose it yourself:
  //      { "name": "Acme Corp", "url": "https://jobs.lever.co/acme" },
  //  (Changing a company's name later makes its jobs look new once.)
  //
  //  Only India jobs from a global company:
  //      { "name": "Acme", "url": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/acme", "locations": ["India"] },
  //  ("India" also covers Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Pune, Mumbai, Gurugram, Chennai, Noida, Delhi ...;
  //   you can list any other place too, e.g. "London".)
  //
  //  Pause a company without deleting it:  { "url": "https://jobs.lever.co/acme", "enabled": false }
  //
  //  Add a keyword: add a line to "keywords", e.g. "Kubernetes",
  //  To match the job TITLE only (less noise):  { "term": "Azure", "scope": "title" },
  //  (Words that appear in nearly every description - Azure, Python, SQL, AWS, "Generative AI" - are title-only below.
  //   Workday companies give no descriptions, so all keywords match the job title only for them.
  //   Delete the "scope" part to also search descriptions - expect many more, noisier results.)
  //
  //  Not sure a link works? Run the workflow with "dry_run" ticked: the log shows [ok] or [FAIL]
  //  for every company. A bad line never stops the other companies; it is listed in the email instead.
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

